OL,3,GNEWSA'I dislike football but loved     
OL,4,Aphotographing Molineux'                
OL,6,FA photographer who admits he has no    
OL,7,Finterest in football visited the home  
OL,8,Fof Wolverhampton Wanderers for his new 
OL,9,Fexhibition.                            
OL,11,FDespite describing himself as someone  
OL,12,Fwho dislikes football Ian Hughes said  
OL,13,Fhe was instead fascinated by Molineux's
OL,14,Farchitecture and the history behind the
OL,15,Fclub.                                  
OL,17,F"I'm recording Wolverhampton," he said.
OL,18,F"The two are intrinsically linked, I   
OL,19,Fthink."                                
